    --- one). info = {dt, state, time (seconds in this state), target, target_position, target_distance,
    --- sees_target, health, max_health, health_fraction, position, home, home_distance, pack_size,
    --- pack_hurt (0..1 of the pack's health lost), leader, phase, attacking, known, heard (where it
    --- last heard something), data}; damaged adds amount and attacker, heard adds noise, noticed adds
    --- noticed.
